Here’s an improved **index.html** page with a modern design, using CSS for a stylish background, a centered registration and login form, and better UI elements.

---

### **index.html**
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Login & Register</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to AI Appointment System</h1>

        <div class="form-box">
            <h2>Register</h2>
            <form action="http://127.0.0.1:8000/register" method="post">
                <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Username" required>
                <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required>
                <button type="submit">Register</button>
            </form>
        </div>

        <div class="form-box">
            <h2>Login</h2>
            <form action="http://127.0.0.1:8000/login" method="post">
                <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Username" required>
                <button type="submit">Login</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```

---

### **styles.css** (Modern Styling with Fancy Background)
```css
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    background: url('https://source.unsplash.com/1600x900/?technology,ai') no-repeat center center fixed;
    background-size: cover;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 100vh;
}

.container {
    text-align: center;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    padding: 30px;
    border-radius: 15px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    color: white;
    max-width: 400px;
}

h1 {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.form-box {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    margin: 10px 0;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

h2 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

input {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px;
    margin: 8px 0;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

button {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 10px;
    background: #ff7eb3;
    border: none;
    color: white;
    font-size: 16px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
    background: #ff4d79;
}
```

---

### **Features:**
✅ **Fancy Background** – Uses a high-quality AI/technology image from Unsplash.  
✅ **Blurred Glass Effect** – Gives a modern, sleek look.  
✅ **Responsive Design** – Works on mobile and desktop.  
✅ **Animated Buttons** – Buttons change color on hover.  

#### **How to Use**
1. Replace your **index.html** and **styles.css** with the code above.
2. Restart your Python server.
3. Open **http://127.0.0.1:8000/** in your browser.

