### **2️⃣ HTML Code to Add Video Background**
Save this as `index.html` inside your project folder:
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
